{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "1cc9c208dd24a8a5766e97fcdc00c7dbca7e4ddd838fce8da490a8210ca0ab6e", "ja": "青い月からのバトン", "zh": "来自蓝月的接力棒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "523a1e6c5d3b5087b42de10e90380f1c9326e29373825bf03b2651f565a68406", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』による、新たな\n天体公演、その第二弾となる『ルナ』のキッ\nクオフミーティングに参加する真、千早、\nあずさ、響。『STARDOM ROAD』と共に\n劇場の中も外も盛り上げようと奮起する。", "zh": "真、千早、梓、响参加了\n『765PRO ALLSTARS』全新\n天体公演的第二弹——『Luna』的动\n员大会。她们振奋精神，誓要与\n『STARDOM ROAD』一同让剧场内外都热闹起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "f03c80def44a7d38217037113bd78ebe328db78870f69dffe738d62a6748c6e4", "ja": "天体公演『ルナ』、キックオフミーティング……", "zh": "天体公演“Luna”，启动会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d9974d09dc307e29726a9c597d8dd26f2b1f08f6d719af5ee431b4506c289e5f", "ja": "というわけで、次の天体公演ツアーのメンバーは、\nこの4人に決まった！", "zh": "所以，下一次天体公演巡演的成员，就定为这4人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "c562977023a973e9981225123dd0000971c87948203e39a7a773f191fe688154", "ja": "待ってました！\nようやく、ボクたちの出番ですね！", "zh": "等很久了！\n终于轮到我们出场了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "38047e86c114c3d26e5a4a4dc68f809d011f98773a6fb86b54e3f216c5f10db0", "ja": "自分もうれしいぞ！\n天体公演、ずっと出てみたかったんだ！", "zh": "我也很高兴！我一直都很想参加天体公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "ea382f10c09219982de734ec9464ecf255458cec4879e060c8cb62a0402c7993", "ja": "うふふっ。私も今までは見てる側でしたから、\nとっても嬉しいです～♪", "zh": "呵呵。因为我之前也一直都是观众，\n现在真的很开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "bbb77d55667622fe47f12a6e3afcead62b7f4e69caf6d41028f18926a2ab6930", "ja": "開幕公演は、亜美たちの『ソル』でしたね。\nでは、私たちは……？", "zh": "开场公演是亚美她们的《太阳》呢。那么，我们是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "27a77400df71d0ea26563c5be1306a2c010ce8e6ea074a9365d1195a0dbac8c1", "ja": "月がモチーフの『ルナ』だ。月といえば、後輩たちの\n『BlueMoon Harmony』公演があったけど……。", "zh": "以月亮为主题的《Luna》。说到月亮，后辈们有过《BlueMoon Harmony》的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "293ecf2f793a00e2b1434d86f0f9862ad7ac6f3420505e32718bc9be490d0289", "ja": "それを受けての、この4人ならではの\n『月』の輝きを見せてほしい。", "zh": "希望你们展现出只有这4人才能展现的“月”之光辉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5edfacdd452b355e9013f42996632ac32b223f1d5092496093f574e0571f932d", "ja": "公演で披露する曲も、月のように陰がありながら、\n力強さもある、疾走感のある曲にしてもらうつもりだ。", "zh": "公演上要呈现的歌曲，我打算选一首如月亮般带着阴影，却也充满力量、富有疾驰感的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "2ef6964b2cfcb5fe55f49c3a1d6ec5d10a74160aba3fc9f008c640bc1f9f00ba", "ja": "まぁ。なんだかカッコよさそう……。\nご期待に応えられるよう、しっかり頑張ります♪", "zh": "哎呀，听起来好像会很帅气……  \n为了不辜负期待，我会好好努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "1321e1b4a796a6fd5fff59a99d81ea2cfeeece61d33d010f038a3732684977d9", "ja": "じゃあ、あずささんと千早がカッコよく歌って、\n響とボクはダンスで決める！ってプランですね？", "zh": "也就是说，由千早和あずさ小姐帅气地歌唱，我和响用舞蹈一决胜负！是这样的计划吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "953fb275b40d1f181be847c9cd6485834fa1fb14e1f9e7ed3db3416b4804145a", "ja": "おおっ、カンペキだぞ、{$P$}！\nちゃんと考えて選んだんだね。見直したさー！", "zh": "哦哦，完美极了，{$P$}！\n你是认真思考后做出的选择呢。让我刮目相看啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a65dc9683bafd4c5bbe16635b1cab2a5050c71f554cc7a54aaba6be05879ad76", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nいつもちゃんと考えてるけどな？", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。\n不过我一直都有认真考虑啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "ea593de341fc695cb2b86938b3b324cdfa9864469cdba6fe3f37a4b4df0aab4f", "ja": "でも、{$P$}。\n劇場公演とツアーを並行して、本当に大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "不过，{$P$}。\n剧场公演和巡演同时进行，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "b8a15f812bdb261900cfab6d1ff066199db99eedf49eadda5aff5461ad85e11b", "ja": "あ、『STARDOM ROAD』も盛り上がってるよね。\n{$P$}、忙しすぎるんじゃ？", "zh": "啊，《STARDOM ROAD》也正热闹着呢。\n{$P$}，是不是忙过头了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3ade7edaf85b864e38a864a4669a572eeeaf99766876b2206b3cd044d10324c6", "ja": "確かに大変だけど、毎日公演してるわけじゃないから。\nそれに……。", "zh": "确实挺辛苦的，但也不是每天都有演出。\n而且……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e2070d12037f0e1505ce7d50f690fc9acbb21336dc319f8b2ca73be414212e22", "ja": "劇場のメンバー達も、もう新人じゃない。\n自分達の公演を作りあげられる、立派なメンバーだ。", "zh": "剧场的成员们也已经不再是新人了。\n她们都是能够打造出属于自己的公演的优秀成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3820f6595f19b3d6767a5555ada688e4f26a6fcdd74dca6f4827b92e3c05662c", "ja": "だからこそ、劇場とツアーの両方で盛り上げていける。\n今は『ルナ』をしっかりプロデュースさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "正因如此，才能让剧场和巡演两边都热闹起来。\n现在就让我好好负责制作《Luna》吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "a9c539fc4de3fd540c6591d3e4950d81413b1c6c64b5459cbe495da53edb0fcb", "ja": "……。わかりました。", "zh": "……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "8e2a84ededebb267e9d073cf637cec722b09b0b12d49ce6ec638b0dedba05223", "ja": "それじゃ、当分は私たち4人で、\n{$P$}さんを独占ね、千早ちゃん♪", "zh": "那接下来，暂时就由我们这4个人独占{$P$}先生吧，千早♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "36d4f8d41ef9d825d757fd4023b013425915cc31dc1e85b0e491e051fa087bf9", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。{$P$}、\nあらためてご指導、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "是、是啊……。{$P$}，今后还请您多多指导。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a1d806e261e8c165abf6011419dbaefe736b449f3810487bd6b8e3059aa9126d", "ja": "こちらこそ。ステージプランもしっかり詰めて、\nみんなでツアーを成功させよう！", "zh": "我才要请您多多指教。我们也要把舞台方案好好敲定，大家一起让巡演取得成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "973314168ad61dc38264bbf614d6ab345849c5a841a80646f0deab5c98423669", "ja": "はい。今の私たちのすべてで、\n最高の公演にできればと。", "zh": "是的。希望能倾尽现在的我们，呈现最棒的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "508d6d6c45f10ca53374bc61d5cceb79c6022da730587c8873b5f924beb70e4e", "ja": "{$P$}は大船に乗ったつもりでいてよ\nね！　自分たちに任せれば、なんくるないさー！", "zh": "{$P$}就尽管放一百个心吧！交给咱们的话，总会有办法的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4e0cf70867dea79f581d5d85016cce54480fad49601c8addbfd04b30aaecba0b", "ja": "ああ、頼りにしてるよ。", "zh": "啊，我就指望你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "286d39b6046f39b1335debd08e3ed5d454adec79f6c3005e1dd72eaefd919322", "ja": "劇場の中でも外でも、かぁ。みんな頑張ってるし、\nうん、こっちも負けてられないよね。", "zh": "不管是在剧场里还是在外面啊。大家都在努力，\n嗯，我们这边也不能输给大家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "58710da143edef199e6b6f1cfbbe0bc52b7a224d5af97f21225ebd3f1c796206", "ja": "よーし！　ボク達『ルナ』が劇場を照らすぐらいの\nつもりで、みんな、がんばろう！", "zh": "好——！大家就抱着由我们“Luna”来照亮剧场的\n决心，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_01_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
